{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Backrooms Deluxe 2 is a spin on The Backrooms Deluxe with new features such as:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modifiers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match positive and negative effects that give you more or less Deluxe Coins at the end of your run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Much better multiplayer replication</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire game has been rewritten to support a much more seamless multiplayer experience.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Achievements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has received more achievements, as well as support for non-Steam achievements (only in the game but don't affect Steam progression) for harder challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelite Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the original game, permadeath has been added, which adds a new element of challenge as well as being able to earn Deluxe Coins without having to do a full run every time. All players have to die for the run to end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4066790?t=1761431059","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4066790?t=1761431059","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066790/9b0666af9e00d0f912393868ea1241bf51badaee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761431059","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066790/9b0666af9e00d0f912393868ea1241bf51badaee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761431059","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Backrooms Deluxe 2 is a spin on The Backrooms Deluxe with new features such as:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modifiers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match positive and negative effects that give you more or less Deluxe Coins at the end of your run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Much better multiplayer replication</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire game has been rewritten to support a much more seamless multiplayer experience.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Achievements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has received more achievements, as well as support for non-Steam achievements (only in the game but don't affect Steam progression) for harder challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelite Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the original game, permadeath has been added, which adds a new element of challenge as well as being able to earn Deluxe Coins without having to do a full run every time. All players have to die for the run to end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Lory Games"],"dlc":[4066930],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066790/442facae7ea0c095317f20fd107f3441b01d951f/header.jpg?t=1761431059","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"The Backrooms Deluxe 2","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 8th Generation and higher or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong